{"game": "mass-effect-andromeda", "language": "english", "appid": 1238000, "month": "2025-01", "window": 2, "start_date": 1736294400, "end_date": 1736985599, "month_true_total": 153, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 22:01:03 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "185673352", "author": {"steamid": "76561198044573240", "personaname": "Xavius", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Tomohawk744/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 675, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 675, "last_played": 1736978627, "avatar": "82b1bcae2bdc3ac16cd1613afef1698361d735bb"}, "language": "english", "review": "I can't find enjoyment out of this game. Combat is lackluster and uninteresting, story is slow and the movement feels horrible", "timestamp_created": 1736978708, "timestamp_updated": 1736978708, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.538553714752197266", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "185653001", "author": {"steamid": "76561198196328626", "personaname": "GainedOrpheus20", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198196328626/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 4629, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4629, "last_played": 1736956355, "avatar": "30714066b1efef7903118f56981f01995387a929"}, "language": "english", "review": "Long time fan of the Mass Effect games so It's 100% a yes from me. Recommend.", "timestamp_created": 1736956667, "timestamp_updated": 1736956667, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "185643415", "author": {"steamid": "76561198848986717", "personaname": "snuke", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198848986717/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 51, "playtime_forever": 3797, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3797, "last_played": 1736898807, "avatar": "8dfe278c7493b6984540e57ecd57b791df13841e"}, "language": "english", "review": "This one is tough, I wish I could give a mixed review. This is a fun game that gets a lot of hate for the state it was in at launch, which is no longer the case. The game certainly has its flaws, the top two I'd point to being the unbelievable amount of fetch quests and the marvelization of the character dialogue. Fetch quests can be useful in games of massive scale, sometimes the player needs direction or a push to go back to areas they explored earlier that have had new content arrive, but this is excessive. I think people over hate these characters and overestimate the amount of story impacting decisions are made in ME1. This game was not given a sequel, and did not get the chance to have your choices make an impact over the course of a trilogy. Overall, the story is well done and the game play is fun. To me, this does feel like a mass effect game, and while it does not quite live up to the original trilogy, I enjoyed it", "timestamp_created": 1736946044, "timestamp_updated": 1736946131, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "185634243", "author": {"steamid": "76561198277579565", "personaname": "DeeDeeMegaDooDoo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198277579565/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 1308, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1140, "last_played": 1739488343, "avatar": "7b4f1ed1aec9f23d3aa42b0f382d3b8e38425403"}, "language": "english", "review": "So far so good.", "timestamp_created": 1736933035, "timestamp_updated": 1736933035, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "185607792", "author": {"steamid": "76561198075825566", "personaname": "Seb4", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/SpoiBLU/", "num_games_owned": 195, "num_reviews": 46, "playtime_forever": 843, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 843, "last_played": 1660003539, "avatar": "be458d103d784091f3d1e6eb6933eb6986a6af80"}, "language": "english", "review": "They banked on the game's success and being able to do another trilogy, when unfortunately the game vastly under performed. Andromeda leans heavily into the exploration aspect of Mass Effect 1, which I find to be very divisive among fans, leading to a lot of people finding it extremely boring / tedious. The story seems watered down, the alien races are far less interesting, the companions were dry and the whole experience was just a drag to get through.\n\nI have a slimmer of hope that the next mass effect title will be a return to form, though Andromeda was a huge step down when compared to the original trilogy.", "timestamp_created": 1736892120, "timestamp_updated": 1736892120, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 45, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.670555412769317627", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 9, "count": 3}, {"reaction_type": 13, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}]}]}